{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Humor and Health"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Discussing How to Deal with Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To discuss how to deal with problems such as health issues, you can use modals like <span class =\"italic\">might, could, or should</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with \u201c<span class =\"italic\">If ... </span>\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201cto\u201d. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you are tense and worried all the time, you should try to find ways of relaxing. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's not always easy, but everyone should learn how to relax. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Someone's Feelings and Reactions "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You talk about feelings and reactions using adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> are used to describe how a person feels, like <span class =\"italic\">relaxed, surprised, confused, worried, energized or tired</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span> are used to describe things and situations, like <span class =\"italic\">relaxing, surprising, confusing, worrying, energizing</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tiring</span>.  These adjectives describe the <span class =\"italic\">effect</span> something has on a person."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Now, personality tests are something many people find fascinating. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Yawning is an energizing experience."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to yawn"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to breathe in a large amount of air due to fatigue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When you yawn, your body naturally relaxes itself. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about humor and health."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tension"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stress or pain in the body due to fatigue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We all know that tension affects us physically."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "worry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "concern over a problem or situation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Worry can also have an affect on our physical health."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stretch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move your limbs (legs, arms, etc.) to improve the flexibility of the muscles"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When you stretch, your body finds a relaxed position. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to laugh"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to respond to a comical situation with a natural reaction of the core body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Another wonderful way to relax is by laughing. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "illness"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the condition of being unhealthy or sick"}, {"type": "part_