ntent": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le02ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "We all know that tension and worry often affect us physically. If you are under a lot of stress or feel tired, you may even develop an illness. If you are tense and worried all the time, you should try to find ways of relaxing. The mind affects the body.", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le02ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "When we feel relaxed, our bodies simply feel better and we can accomplish tasks more successfully.  It's not always easy, but everyone should learn how to relax. Athletes, singers and actors are aware of this.  Only when they relax can their minds and bodies perform well.", "time": "17000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le02ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "It may seem surprising, but one standard drama school exercise that anyone can do is simply yawning. When you yawn and stretch, your body naturally relaxes itself. All you have to do is to seriously start pretending to yawn, and then your body will take over and you will really start yawning!  It's an energizing experience.", "time": "35000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le02ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Another wonderful way to relax is by laughing. Start laughing by just doing it, and then the body will naturally take over. Laughter is one of nature's gifts to human beings \u2013 and this is why it is often called the best medicine of all.", "time": "57500", "id": 4, "image": "engenn7le02ob03re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le02ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le02ob03re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}]}]}